---
interface Props { data:any }
const { data } = Astro.props;
---
<div class="vacations-experience">
<section class="hero"><div class="wrap crumb"><b>Trabajo</b> &nbsp;/&nbsp; Vacaciones</div><div class="wrap hero-grid">
    <div class="copy"><span class="eyebrow">Vacaciones y licencias 2026</span><h1>¿Cuántos días<br>te corresponden<br>y cuánto cobrás?</h1><p>Calculá tus vacaciones por antigüedad, el pago antes de salir y las fechas que tu empleador debe respetar.</p><div class="chips"><span>📅 LCT arts. 150–158</span><span>✓ Días corridos</span><span>💵 Pago anticipado</span></div><div class="vac-art"><div class="calendar"><div class="cal-head"><span>DICIEMBRE 2026</span><div class="rings"><i></i><i></i></div></div><div class="cal-body"><small>TE CORRESPONDEN</small><strong>21 días</strong><span>7 años de antigüedad</span></div></div><div class="sun"></div><div class="bag"></div><span class="pay-tag">Cobrás antes de salir</span></div></div>
    <form class="calc"><div class="calc-title"><div><h2>Calculá tus vacaciones</h2><p>Empezamos por las vacaciones anuales.</p></div><span class="tag">Ley vigente</span></div><div class="section-label">¿Qué necesitás calcular?</div><div class="cases"><button type="button" class="case active" data-case="annual"><i>🏖️</i>Por antigüedad</button><button type="button" class="case" data-case="partial"><i>📆</i>Proporcionales</button><button type="button" class="case" data-case="pay"><i>💵</i>Pago vacacional</button><button type="button" class="case" data-case="special"><i>📋</i>Licencia especial</button></div><div class="section-label">Tus datos</div><div class="fields"><div class="field"><label>Fecha de ingreso</label><input id="vac-start" type="date" value="2019-03-01"></div><div class="field"><label>Sueldo bruto mensual</label><div class="inline"><b>$</b><input id="vac-salary" value="1.500.000"></div></div><div class="field wide"><label>¿Trabajaste más de la mitad del año?</label><select id="vac-half"><option value="yes">Sí, me corresponden vacaciones completas</option><option value="no">No, estimar según mi fecha de ingreso</option></select></div><div class="field wide"><label>Convenio</label><select id="vac-cct"><option value="lct">LCT general</option><option value="commerce">Comercio CCT 130/75</option></select></div></div><div class="advanced"><span>✓ Antigüedad al 31 de diciembre</span><b>+ Afinar cálculo</b></div><section class="result"><div class="result-top"><div><small id="result-label">Vacaciones que te corresponden</small><div class="days" id="result-days">21 días corridos</div></div><div class="pay"><small>Pago estimado</small><strong id="result-pay">$1.260.000</strong></div></div><div class="stats"><span>Antigüedad<b id="vac-years">7 años</b></span><span>Valor por día<b id="vac-day-value">$60.000</b></span><span>Plus vacacional<b id="vac-plus">+$210.000</b></span></div><button class="go" type="button">Actualizar vacaciones</button></section></form>
  </div></section>
  <section class="timeline-section wrap"><header class="center"><span>La escala de la antigüedad</span><h2>Más años trabajados, más días de descanso</h2><p>La ley usa cuatro escalones. La antigüedad se mide al 31 de diciembre del año en que tomás las vacaciones.</p></header><div class="scale"><div class="step"><div class="dot">14</div><h3>Hasta 5 años</h3><p>Días corridos</p></div><div class="step active"><div class="dot">21</div><h3>De 5 a 10 años</h3><p>Tu tramo actual</p></div><div class="step"><div class="dot">28</div><h3>De 10 a 20 años</h3><p>Días corridos</p></div><div class="step"><div class="dot">35</div><h3>Más de 20 años</h3><p>Días corridos</p></div></div><div class="next"><i>⏳</i><span>Te faltan <b>2 años y 4 meses</b> para pasar al tramo de 28 días. El salto se aplica cuando superás los 10 años al 31 de diciembre.</span></div></section>
  <section class="money"><div class="wrap"><header class="center"><span>El pago vacacional</span><h2>Por qué cobrás más por cada día de vacaciones</h2><p>Para mensualizados, el día de vacaciones se calcula dividiendo el sueldo por 25, no por 30.</p></header><div class="money-grid"><article class="card"><h3>Tu cálculo, paso por paso</h3><div class="formula"><div><small>Sueldo bruto</small><b>$1.500.000</b></div><strong>÷</strong><div><small>Divisor legal</small><b>25</b></div><strong>×</strong><div><small>Días</small><b>21</b></div></div><div class="difference"><span>Pago total antes de salir</span><b>$1.260.000</b></div></article><article class="card"><h3>Tres reglas importantes</h3><div class="rule"><i>💳</i><div><b>Se paga antes de empezar</b><span>Tenés que recibir el importe al inicio de la licencia.</span></div></div><div class="rule"><i>📅</i><div><b>Son días corridos</b><span>Cuentan sábados, domingos y feriados.</span></div></div><div class="rule"><i>🚫</i><div><b>No se cambian por plata</b><span>Salvo cuando termina la relación laboral.</span></div></div></article></div></div></section>
  <section class="licenses"><div class="wrap"><div class="licenses-head"><div><span>Otras licencias</span><h2>Todos los casos, a mano</h2></div><div class="legend">Pisos de la LCT · el convenio puede mejorarlos</div></div><div class="license-grid"><article class="license"><i>👶</i><h3>Nacimiento</h3><p>Licencia especial para el progenitor no gestante.</p><b>2 días corridos</b><span>Art. 158 inc. a</span></article><article class="license"><i>🕊️</i><h3>Fallecimiento</h3><p>Cónyuge, hijo o padres; cambia para hermanos.</p><b>3 días corridos</b><span>1 día por hermano</span></article><article class="license"><i>📚</i><h3>Examen</h3><p>Para estudiantes de enseñanza media o universitaria.</p><b>2 días por examen</b><span>Hasta 10 por año</span></article><article class="license"><i>💍</i><h3>Matrimonio</h3><p>Licencia paga adicional a las vacaciones anuales.</p><b>10 días corridos</b><span>Art. 158 inc. b</span></article></div></div></section>
  <section class="notice"><div class="wrap notice-grid"><div><span class="eyebrow" style="color:#86bfff">Fechas que importan</span><h2>No alcanza con decirte “tomate vacaciones”.</h2><p>El empleador debe avisarte por escrito y respetar el período legal de otorgamiento.</p></div><div class="notice-card"><div><small>PERÍODO PARA TOMARLAS</small><b>1 oct. → 30 abr.</b><span>Salvo autorización especial</span></div><div><small>AVISO MÍNIMO</small><b>45 días</b><span>Por escrito</span></div><div><small>PRÓXIMO DESCANSO</small><b>21 días</b><span>Sin descontar fines de semana</span></div></div></div></section><div class="foot"></div>
  <section class="support wrap"><div><h2>Preguntas frecuentes</h2>{data.faq.map((f:any,i:number)=><details open={i===0}><summary>{f.q}</summary><p set:html={f.a}/></details>)}</div><aside><h2>Fuentes</h2>{data.sources.map((s:any)=><a href={s.url} target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">{s.name}<small>{s.publisher}</small></a>)}</aside></section>
</div>
<script is:inline>
(()=>{const root=document.querySelector(".vacations-experience"),q=s=>root.querySelector(s),all=s=>root.querySelectorAll(s),money=n=>"$"+Math.round(Math.max(0,n)||0).toLocaleString("es-AR"),num=el=>Number(String(el.value).replace(/\./g,"").replace(",","."))||0;let mode="annual";
const calc=()=>{const start=new Date(q("#vac-start").value+"T00:00:00"),now=new Date(),close=new Date(now.getFullYear(),11,31),years=Math.max(0,(close-start)/31557600000),full=years<5?14:years<10?21:years<20?28:35,worked=Math.max(0,(Math.min(now,close)-Math.max(start,new Date(now.getFullYear(),0,1)))/86400000),partial=Math.max(1,Math.floor(worked*5/7/20)),salary=Math.max(0,num(q("#vac-salary")));let days=mode==="partial"||q("#vac-half").value==="no"?partial:full;if(mode==="special")days=2;const basePay=salary/25*days,commerce=q("#vac-cct").value==="commerce"?basePay*.03:0,pay=basePay+commerce,plus=pay-salary/30*days;q("#result-label").textContent=mode==="special"?"Licencia especial":mode==="pay"?"Pago vacacional estimado":mode==="partial"?"Vacaciones proporcionales":"Vacaciones que te corresponden";q("#result-days").textContent=mode==="pay"?days+" días pagados":days+" días corridos";q("#result-pay").textContent=money(pay);q("#vac-years").textContent=Math.floor(years)+" años";q("#vac-day-value").textContent=money(salary/25);q("#vac-plus").textContent="+"+money(plus)};
all(".case").forEach(b=>b.addEventListener("click",()=>{all(".case").forEach(x=>x.classList.remove("active"));b.classList.add("active");mode=b.dataset.case;calc()}));all(".calc input,.calc select").forEach(el=>el.addEventListener("input",calc));q(".go").addEventListener("click",e=>{const button=e.currentTarget;calc();button.textContent="✓ Vacaciones actualizadas";setTimeout(()=>button.textContent="Actualizar vacaciones",1200)});calc()})();
</script>
<style>
.vacations-experience{width:100%;overflow:hidden;color:#111f39;background:#fff;font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif}
*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;color:#10223c;background:#fff}button,input,select{font:inherit}button:focus{outline:none}.wrap{width:min(1160px,calc(100% - 40px));margin:auto}
    .top{height:88px;border-bottom:1px solid #dfe8ee;display:flex;align-items:center;background:#fff}.nav{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;font-size:18px;font-weight:850}.logo{width:31px;height:31px;border-radius:7px;background:#173452;display:grid;place-items:center;color:#fff;font-size:14px}.links,.tools{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:27px}.links a{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#43526a}.tools span{border:1px solid #d9e2eb;border-radius:10px;padding:11px 14px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700}.tools .profile{background:#132844;color:#fff;border-color:#132844}
    .hero{background:linear-gradient(128deg,#f6faff 0%,#f6faff 59%,#fff8e9 100%);padding:25px 0 62px;overflow:hidden}.crumb{font-size:12px;color:#718299;margin-bottom:32px}.crumb b{color:#1475cf}.hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.88fr 1.12fr;gap:52px;align-items:start}.hero-grid>*{min-width:0}.copy{padding-top:6px}.eyebrow{font-size:11px;font-weight:850;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1475cf;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px}.eyebrow:before{content:"";width:28px;height:2px;background:#1475cf}.copy h1{font-size:51px;line-height:1.04;letter-spacing:-.052em;margin:18px 0;color:#0e1d36}.copy>p{font-size:17px;line-height:1.65;color:#5f7187;max-width:500px}.chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-top:23px}.chips span{background:#fff;border:1px solid #dbe5ed;border-radius:9px;padding:9px 11px;color:#53677e;font-size:10px}
    .vac-art{height:238px;margin-top:15px;position:relative}.calendar{position:absolute;left:52px;top:23px;width:238px;height:174px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #d8e5ed;border-radius:18px;box-shadow:0 24px 48px #17385816;overflow:hidden;transform:rotate(-2deg)}.cal-head{height:49px;background:#247fd1;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:0 20px;font-size:10px;font-weight:800}.rings{display:flex;gap:8px}.rings i{display:block;width:5px;height:18px;background:#173858;border-radius:99px;margin-top:-22px}.cal-body{padding:17px 21px}.cal-body small{font-size:8px;color:#718498}.cal-body strong{display:block;font-size:39px;letter-spacing:-.06em;margin-top:2px;color:#173858}.cal-body span{font-size:9px;color:#1b7d55;background:#e6f6ee;border-radius:99px;padding:5px 8px}.sun{position:absolute;right:48px;top:2px;width:72px;height:72px;border-radius:50%;background:#ffd469;border:8px solid #fff5d8;box-shadow:0 10px 20px #b4892222}.bag{position:absolute;right:30px;bottom:11px;width:95px;height:67px;background:#ef9b55;border-radius:15px 15px 10px 10px;border:5px solid #fff;box-shadow:0 10px 24px #82532222}.bag:before{content:"";position:absolute;width:38px;height:21px;border:7px solid #b76b35;border-bottom:0;border-radius:12px 12px 0 0;left:23px;top:-24px}.bag:after{content:"✈";position:absolute;inset:0;display:grid;place-items:center;color:#fff;font-size:24px}.pay-tag{position:absolute;left:5px;bottom:17px;background:#e8f4ff;color:#176fbf;border:1px solid #cfe2f4;border-radius:9px;padding:9px 11px;font-size:10px;font-weight:800}
    .calc{background:#fff;border:1px solid #d8e4eb;border-radius:20px;padding:26px 29px;box-shadow:0 25px 60px #173b6418;position:relative;z-index:2}.calc-title{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px}.calc h2{font-size:23px;margin:0 0 4px}.calc-title p{font-size:10px;color:#6b7d91;margin:0}.tag{font-size:9px;color:#1475cf;background:#e8f4ff;border-radius:99px;padding:7px 10px;font-weight:800;height:max-content;white-space:nowrap}.section-label{font-size:10px;font-weight:850;color:#293b53;margin:17px 0 8px}.cases{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:7px}.case{border:1px solid #dce5ec;background:#fff;border-radius:10px;padding:9px 5px;color:#5d7188;font-size:8px;font-weight:750;min-height:65px;cursor:pointer}.case i{display:block;font-style:normal;font-size:17px;margin-bottom:3px}.case.active{border:2px solid #247fd1;background:#eff7ff;color:#166cb9}.fields{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:9px}.field{border:1px solid #dbe4eb;border-radius:10px;padding:9px 11px;min-height:57px}.field.wide{grid-column:span 2}.field label{display:block;color:#77879a;font-size:8px;margin-bottom:5px}.field input,.field select{border:0;outline:0;background:none;width:100%;color:#142641;font-weight:750;font-size:13px}.inline{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px}.inline b{font-size:12px}.advanced{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin:11px 0;color:#65788d;font-size:9px}.advanced b{color:#1475cf}.result{background:#17324f;color:#fff;border-radius:15px;padding:18px 20px}.result-top{display:flex;align-items:start;justify-content:space-between}.result small{font-size:9px;color:#b9cbdd}.days{font-size:34px;letter-spacing:-.04em;font-weight:850;margin-top:4px}.pay{background:#fff3cf;color:#76551d;border-radius:9px;padding:8px 11px;text-align:right}.pay strong{display:block;font-size:15px}.stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:8px;border-top:1px solid #375675;padding-top:12px;margin-top:13px}.stats span{font-size:8px;color:#afc0d1}.stats b{display:block;color:#fff;font-size:11px;margin-top:3px}.go{width:100%;border:0;border-radius:9px;background:#247fd1;color:#fff;font-weight:800;padding:12px;margin-top:14px;cursor:pointer}
    .timeline-section{padding:74px 0 67px}.center{text-align:center;max-width:720px;margin:0 auto 36px}.center span{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1475cf;font-weight:850}.center h2{font-size:36px;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:10px 0}.center p{color:#687a8f;line-height:1.6}.scale{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:10px;position:relative}.scale:before{content:"";position:absolute;left:12%;right:12%;top:32px;height:3px;background:#dce8f2}.step{position:relative;text-align:center}.dot{width:65px;height:65px;border:6px solid #edf4fa;background:#fff;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;margin:0 auto 13px;position:relative;z-index:1;font-size:14px;font-weight:900;color:#557188}.step.active .dot{background:#247fd1;color:#fff;border-color:#dceeff;box-shadow:0 8px 20px #247fd133}.step h3{font-size:12px;margin:0 0 5px}.step p{font-size:9px;color:#75879a;margin:0}.next{margin:30px auto 0;max-width:560px;background:#fff8e8;border:1px solid #f0ddb0;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 17px;display:flex;gap:11px;align-items:center;color:#77581e;font-size:10px;line-height:1.5}.next i{font-style:normal;font-size:20px}
    .money{background:#f4f8fb;padding:68px 0}.money-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.05fr .95fr;gap:20px}.card{background:#fff;border:1px solid #dce5ec;border-radius:16px;padding:25px;box-shadow:0 10px 27px #1738580b}.card h3{font-size:18px;margin:0 0 19px}.formula{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto 1fr auto 1fr;gap:9px;align-items:center}.formula div{background:#f6f9fb;border:1px solid #e0e8ee;border-radius:11px;padding:15px;text-align:center}.formula small{display:block;color:#74879a;font-size:8px}.formula b{display:block;font-size:17px;margin-top:5px}.formula>strong{color:#7c8d9e}.difference{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;background:#e9f5ff;border-radius:11px;padding:14px 16px;margin-top:14px;color:#176cb6}.difference span{font-size:10px}.difference b{font-size:14px}.rule{display:flex;gap:11px;margin:14px 0}.rule i{font-style:normal;width:31px;height:31px;background:#e8f4ff;border-radius:9px;display:grid;place-items:center;flex:none}.rule b{display:block;font-size:10px}.rule span{display:block;font-size:9px;color:#74879a;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.45}
    .licenses{padding:69px 0}.licenses-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end;margin-bottom:27px}.licenses-head h2{font-size:34px;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:8px 0 0}.licenses-head>div>span{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1475cf;font-weight:850}.legend{font-size:9px;color:#64778d}.license-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:12px}.license{background:#fff;border:1px solid #dce5ec;border-radius:14px;padding:18px;min-height:180px}.license i{font-style:normal;font-size:23px}.license h3{font-size:13px;margin:11px 0 6px}.license p{font-size:9px;color:#77899c;line-height:1.55;margin:0}.license b{display:block;color:#1475cf;font-size:17px;margin-top:17px}.license span{font-size:8px;color:#7a8b9e}.notice{background:#17324f;padding:65px 0;color:#fff}.notice-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.75fr 1.25fr;gap:50px;align-items:center}.notice h2{font-size:35px;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:8px 0 13px}.notice p{font-size:12px;line-height:1.65;color:#bdccda}.notice-card{background:#fff;color:#17324f;border-radius:16px;padding:23px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:12px}.notice-card div{border-right:1px solid #e3e9ee;padding:5px 13px}.notice-card div:last-child{border:0}.notice-card small{display:block;font-size:8px;color:#74879a}.notice-card b{display:block;font-size:21px;margin:6px 0}.notice-card span{font-size:8px;color:#718397}.foot{height:110px}
    @media(max-width:800px){.wrap{width:min(100% - 28px,1160px)}.links{display:none}.hero-grid,.money-grid,.notice-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.copy{text-align:center}.copy h1{font-size:39px}.eyebrow,.chips{justify-content:center}.vac-art{max-width:390px;margin-inline:auto}.calc{padding:20px 16px}.cases{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.scale{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:25px}.scale:before{display:none}.license-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.licenses-head{display:block}.legend{margin-top:10px}.tools span:not(:last-child){display:none}}@media(max-width:480px){.copy h1{font-size:36px}.calendar{left:23px}.sun{right:13px}.bag{right:6px}.fields{grid-template-columns:1fr}.field.wide{grid-column:auto}.stats{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.formula{grid-template-columns:1fr}.formula>strong{transform:rotate(90deg)}.license-grid,.notice-card{grid-template-columns:1fr}.notice-card div{border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid #e3e9ee}}
.support{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr;gap:40px;padding:70px 0}.support h2{font-size:24px}.support details{border-bottom:1px solid #dfe6ed;padding:14px 0}.support summary{font-size:12px;font-weight:750;cursor:pointer}.support p{font-size:11px;line-height:1.65;color:#687a8f}.support a{display:block;border:1px solid #dce5ee;border-radius:10px;padding:12px;margin:8px 0;color:#397dd0;text-decoration:none;font-size:10px;font-weight:700}.support small{display:block;color:#78899c;margin-top:4px}
